WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:29.060
My brother and I were on a bus when we met a man handing out gospel leaflets.

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:55.040
He wore a vest that read, “God loves the world; Jesus saves,” and offered leaflets to passengers.

00:00:55.970 --> 00:01:22.970
He invited people to hear the gospel. We thought it was funny, but smiled and took one.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:49.490
We put it in our pockets and forgot about it. At home, our mother found it while doing laundry.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:02:17.400
The leaflet invited people to hear the gospel and know the one true and living God.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:47.400
Her eyes lit up: “Isn’t this the true and living God I’ve been seeking?”

00:02:47.600 --> 00:03:17.500
She talked with our father and asked us, “Shall we all go and listen?”

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:45.700
Around Lunar New Year in 1963, all four of us went to three days of gospel meetings.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:04:13.880
Later, all four of us were baptized together.
